#: getbacktracewidget.cpp:165
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "This crash information is probably not useful"
msgstr "ព័ត៌មានគាំង​មិនមាន​ប្រយោជន៍​គ្រប់គ្រាន់​ទេ "

#: getbacktracewidget.cpp:168
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "This crash information is not useful"
